.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-path 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-path \- Print whether a head may write main: its pin is inherited, or it changes only the release paths to a verified published release
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release path\fR [\fB\-\-post\fR] [\fB\-\-seal\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsha\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print whether a head may write main: its pin is inherited, or it changes only the release paths to a verified published release
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-post\fR
Post the verdict as the release\-path commit status on the graded head
.TP
\fB\-\-seal\fR
Exit 1 when the verdict is failure and the head is not release\-shaped or the release guard\*(Aqs settings are not green
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIsha\fR>
The head commit graded
